  "hints": [
    "Anything that is lit is free to walk: no turns pass until you record or launch. Power the route at the console first.",
    "Walk left to the console, switch on LIFT-POWER, walk back to the start, save an empty recording ({key:echo} twice), launch with {key:echo}, then follow the corridor east and down to the lift."
